# TECH_MV HCELL exact exclusions
#
# These three level-shifter cells were the only stdcell HCELLs still INCORRECT
# after enabling foundry WELL_TEXT. Calibre extraction reports duplicated VPP
# M1 text on physically distinct nets inside each cell, and source HCELL high-
# shorts VDD/VPP. Keep them out of explicit HCELL so full-chip context can
# resolve their abutment/well connectivity without sacrificing HCELL reuse for
# the remaining ~3.7k library cells.
FILL_IN_LIST_ITEM_9
FILL_IN_LIST_ITEM_10
FILL_IN_LIST_ITEM_11
FILL_IN_LIST_ITEM_12
